{"total_count":1048,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/commits/6d45d7a6c331ddb856ac34a76bcd3613aa05185b","sha":"6d45d7a6c331ddb856ac34a76bcd3613aa05185b","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0NjU2MDA5NzU6NmQ0NWQ3YTZjMzMxZGRiODU2YWMzNGE3NmJjZDM2MTNhYTA1MTg1Yg==","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/commit/6d45d7a6c331ddb856ac34a76bcd3613aa05185b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/commits/6d45d7a6c331ddb856ac34a76bcd3613aa05185b/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/git/commits/6d45d7a6c331ddb856ac34a76bcd3613aa05185b","author":{"date":"2021-05-30T22:15:42.000-07:00","name":"Kushashwa Ravi Shrimali","email":"kushashwaravishrimali@gmail.com"},"committer":{"date":"2021-05-30T22:16:46.000-07:00","name":"Facebook GitHub Bot","email":"facebook-github-bot@users.noreply.github.com"},"message":"Enables previously \"slow\" `gradgrad` checks on CUDA (#57802)\n\nSummary:\nFixes https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/57508\n\nEarlier, a few CUDA `gradgrad` checks (see the list of ops below) were disabled because of them being too slow. There have been improvements (see https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/57508 for reference) and this PR aimed on:\n\n1. Time taken by `gradgrad` checks on CUDA for the ops listed below.\n2. Enabling the tests again if the times sound reasonable\n\nOps considered: `addbmm, baddbmm, bmm, cholesky, symeig, inverse, linalg.cholesky, linalg.cholesky_ex, linalg.eigh, linalg.qr, lu, qr, solve, triangular_solve, linalg.pinv, svd, linalg.svd, pinverse, linalg.householder_product, linalg.solve`.\n\nFor numbers (on time taken) on a separate CI run: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/57802#issuecomment-836169691.\n\ncc: mruberry albanD pmeier\n\nPull Request resolved: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/57802\n\nReviewed By: ngimel\n\nDifferential Revision: D28784106\n\nPulled By: mruberry\n\nfbshipit-source-id: 9b15238319f143c59f83d50